   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSDE Ethiopia Landscape of Climate Finance 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSD Africa partnered with CPI to conduct a comprehensive study on Ethiopia&#x2019;s climate finance landscape. CPI applies a robust, standardized methodology to conduct climate finance landscape assessments across multiple markets, and Ethiopia&#x2019;s study followed CPI&#x2019;s regional Africa report as well as country-specific reports for Nigeria and Burkina Faso. The Ethiopia climate finance landscape assessment was instrumental in providing a detailed understanding of the state of climate finance in the country based on data from 2019/2020.</narrative>
  </description>
